<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.2pt;"><img src="2509.10931v1/Figures/HaPLa.jpg" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:15/15;" width="15" height="15" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>Harmful Prompt Laundering: Jailbreaking LLMs with Abductive Styles and Symbolic Encoding</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Seongho Joo
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
